From: Joel Guittet <joelguittet@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Mar 2026 09:16:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] scripts: twister: base_params in the hardware map config
 file

Add the ability to configure additional runner parameters.

For instance the Raspberry Pi boards require a specific openocd version
with rp2xxx driver support.

Signed-off-by: Joel Guittet <joelguittet@gmail.com>
---
